Package: myIO
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Data Visualizations Using 'd3.js'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ryan", "Morton", email = "morton@myma.us",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Create interactive 'd3.js' visualizations from R with built-in
    statistical transforms. Computes confidence intervals, regression fits,
    LOESS smoothing, moving averages, and error bars in R and renders them as
    composable chart layers via 'htmlwidgets'. Supports 20 chart types
    including boxplots, violin plots, Q-Q diagnostic plots, and group
    comparisons with pairwise significance testing. Works in 'RStudio',
    'Shiny', and 'R Markdown'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://mortonanalytics.github.io/myIO/, https://github.com/mortonanalytics/myIO
BugReports: https://github.com/mortonanalytics/myIO/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests:
  testthat (>= 3.0.0),
  knitr,
  rmarkdown,
  pkgdown,
  shiny
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Imports:
